sequenceDiagram
  participant V as Viewer app
  participant S as Rooms server
  participant H as Host app
  V->>S: watch the host's screen (signed offer)
  S->>H: relays the offer
  H->>S: signed answer
  S->>V: relays the answer
  Note over V,H: both gather addresses: LAN, public (STUN), IPv6
  V->>H: ICE checks, direct UDP
  V->>H: DTLS handshake, keys for SRTP
  H->>V: encrypted video and audio, peer to peer
  Note over V,H: no direct path in 15 s: says the likely cause
